            "review_title": "Review at Com GA Hai Nam",
            "review_text": "Chia R\nSingapore, Singapore373 contributions\n0\nA place which seems to be famous for chicken rice\nAug 2018 • Friends\nInterestingly I was told that this is the few places that are good for food in the area. Upon reaching, I was told that the chicken rice there was good. I tried the chicken rice but probably as a Singaporean, I would feel that the taste is very different from what was expected from very nice chicken rice. All I can say is probably I would prefer the chicken rice in Singapore anytime. Maybe different people’s taste will vary. The soup was pretty ok though.\nRead more\nWritten August 31, 2018",
