            "review_title": "Review at Com GA Hai Nam",
            "review_text": "peachy625\nLos Angeles, California2 contributions\n0\nBest grilled chicken!\nAug 2015 • Couples\nCharcoal grilled marinated chicken to perfection. If you're looking for juicy, fall off the bone chicken made with love, this is the place. When we ate there, there were 3 people taking turns tending to the grill, making sure the coal is right, the marinate is brushed on every so often, and the chicken is lip-smacking good!! The only other thing we ordered was Bun Bo Hue (Vietnamese beef noodle soup), while it was decent, chicken is definitely their specialty, don't bother wasting room in your stomach for anything else.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 21, 2015",
